@startuml
title Customer Activity Analytics — Customer review use cases
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor<<MANDATORY>> #FFB3B3
  BackgroundColor<<MUST_HAVE>> #FFD699
  BackgroundColor<<NICE_TO_HAVE>> #D6EAF8
}

actor "Customer Care\nOperator" as Operator
actor "Customer\n<<business stakeholder>>" as Customer

rectangle "Customer Activity Analytics\n<<system boundary>>" as SystemBoundary {
  package "Identity and customer selection" {
    usecase "Authenticate Operator\n[FR-AUTH-001]" as UC_Auth <<MUST_HAVE>>
    usecase "Search Customer by ID\n[FR-CUST-001]" as UC_Search <<MANDATORY>>
  }

  package "Customer activity review" {
    usecase "Review Customer Dashboard\n[FR-ACT-001]" as UC_Dashboard <<MANDATORY>>
    usecase "Review Customer Activity\n[FR-ACT-001]" as UC_Activity <<MANDATORY>>
    usecase "Review CARD Activity\n[FR-ACT-002]" as UC_Card <<MANDATORY>>
    usecase "Review PAYMENT Activity\n[FR-ACT-002]" as UC_Payment <<MANDATORY>>
    usecase "Review CRYPTO Activity\n[FR-ACT-002]" as UC_Crypto <<MANDATORY>>
  }

  package "Risk evidence review" {
    usecase "Review Risk Evidence\n[FR-RISK-001]" as UC_Risk <<MANDATORY>>
  }

  UC_Dashboard .> UC_Activity : <<include>>
  UC_Dashboard .> UC_Risk : <<include>>
  UC_Card -|> UC_Activity
  UC_Payment -|> UC_Activity
  UC_Crypto -|> UC_Activity
}

Operator -- UC_Auth
Operator -- UC_Search
Operator -- UC_Dashboard
Customer ..> UC_Dashboard : <<business subject>>
Customer ..> UC_Activity : <<business subject>>

note bottom of UC_Dashboard
  Protected capability: authentication is a precondition,
  not a decorative <<include>> repeated from every use case.
end note

note right of Customer
  The assignment specifies an operator-facing application.
  Customer is the business stakeholder and subject of review;
  no direct customer interaction with this application is implied.
end note

legend bottom
  |= Notation |= Meaning |
  | Solid actor association | Direct system interaction |
  | Dashed <<business subject>> dependency | Business stakeholder/context only; not UI interaction |
  | <<include>> | Mandatory reused behaviour |
  | <<extend>> | Conditional behaviour inserted under a stated condition |
  | Generalization arrow | Specialized use case inherits common behaviour |
  | Package | Logical grouping inside the system boundary |
  |= Colour |= Delivery priority |
  |<#FFB3B3> | MANDATORY |
  |<#FFD699> | MUST_HAVE |
  |<#D6EAF8> | NICE_TO_HAVE |
endlegend
@enduml
